{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01585","headline":"琴曲歌辞 飞龙引二首 一 · 李白","name":"琴曲歌辞 飞龙引二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄帝铸鼎於荆山，链丹砂。\n丹砂成黄金，骑龙飞上太清家。\n云愁海思令人嗟，宫中彩女颜如花。\n飘然挥手凌紫霞，从风纵体登銮车。\n登銮车，侍轩辕。\n遨游青天中，其乐不可言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}